  "details": "I can't find a way to view reports on open-beta anymore. I think this is a regression.\n\n1. Open Quick Menu\n\n2. Click the Report icon\n\n3. Try to find a View Reports button from this report menu\n\nExpected result: Find the button there in both live (build 1856) and open-beta (build 1863). It's needed to delete open reports, etc.\n\nActual result: Found in live (build 1856). The button has been removed in open-beta (build 1863).\n\nThere's no mention of this change at: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202623-open-beta",
